The following skills are forks of Superpowers skills, rewritten around a tuckit
board: what upstream writes into markdown files lands on a slice instead, and
a person is asked to approve only the promise and the pull request.

  shared/skills/designing-a-slice/   <- skills/brainstorming
  shared/skills/building-a-slice/    <- skills/executing-plans,
                                        skills/finishing-a-development-branch,
                                        skills/verification-before-completion
  shared/skills/reviewing-a-change/  <- skills/requesting-code-review,
                                        skills/receiving-code-review

reviewing-a-change carries a review prompt forked from Superpowers'
skills/subagent-driven-development (task-reviewer-prompt.md ->
reviewer-prompt.md).

The other Superpowers skills are not forked here. This plugin is meant to
replace Superpowers rather than run alongside it, so it does not defer to them
by name.
